                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d7193c71-704e-394e-8b0b-580928d9fbcc",
                        "entry_id": "332d5141-b336-3d23-bf67-fbb9ff4faf8d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "boiled"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "29f22c00-7833-4a23-855f-5332068e6277",
                                "sense_id": "d7193c71-704e-394e-8b0b-580928d9fbcc",
                                "text": "— У губерна́тора, одна́ко ж, недурён стол, — сказа́л Чи́чиков.\n— Да зна́ете ли, из чего́ э́то всё гото́вится? вы есть не ста́нете, когда́ узна́ете.\n— Не зна́ю, как приготовля́ется, об э́том я не могу́ суди́ть, но свины́е котле́ты и разварна́я ры́ба бы́ли превосхо́дны.",
                                "translation": "'The governor keeps a good table, however,' said Tchitchikov.\n'But do you know what it is all made of? You won't eat it when you do know.'\n'I don't know how the dishes were cooked, I can't judge of that; but the pork chops and the stewed fish were excellent.'",
                                "english": "'The governor keeps a good table, however,' said Tchitchikov.\n'But do you know what it is all made of? You won't eat it when you do know.'\n'I don't know how the dishes were cooked, I can't judge of that; but the pork chops and the stewed fish were excellent.'"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "15883fb1-09d1-4b58-b66c-80ce592b7e11",
                                "sense_id": "d7193c71-704e-394e-8b0b-580928d9fbcc",
                                "text": "Сиди́м за стола́ми дли́нными, дубо́выми, непокры́тыми. Подаю́т слу́ги квас суха́рный, щи су́точные, хлеб ржано́й, говя́дину разварну́ю с лу́ком да ка́шу гре́чневую.",
                                "translation": "We sit at long, bare, oak tables. The servants bring us kvass made from bread crumbs, day-old cabbage soup, rye bread, beef boiled with onion, and buckwheat porridge.",
                                "english": "We sit at long, bare, oak tables. The servants bring us kvass made from bread crumbs, day-old cabbage soup, rye bread, beef boiled with onion, and buckwheat porridge."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
